WEBVTT

00:00:29.371 --> 00:00:32.996
to transmit information and thoughts

00:00:33.037 --> 00:00:36.912
by coordinating the activity
of nerve cells.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:41.787
These waves are a little like the effect

00:00:41.787 --> 00:00:46.287
of the orchestra conductor waving a baton

00:00:46.329 --> 00:00:49.496
to keep the musicians synchronized.

00:00:50.746 --> 00:00:52.829
I'm going to talk today

00:00:52.871 --> 00:00:57.454
about the waves that have
the so-called gamma frequency.

00:00:58.079 --> 00:01:01.829
These gamma waves
are particularly important